icant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TANAKA, HIROYUKI</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NOGUCHI TSUYOSHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TANAKA HIROYUKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NOGUCHI, TSUYOSHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TANAKA, HIROYUKI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A dust-free rubber mixer not discharging, into a working room, contaminants such as dirt produced by a rubber mixer, comprising a rubber mixing part having a plurality of rubber mixing rolls and a drive part having a motor, wherein those parts other than the rubber mixing rolls are all covered by a casing, an air inlet is provided in the casing around the rotating shaft of the rubber mixing rolls, an exhaust duct is provided on the casing, and an intake means to reduce a pressure inside the casing to negative is installed onto the exhaust duct.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention porte sur un mélangeur de caoutchouc ne produisant pas dans l'atelier de contaminants tels que les poussières produites en cours de mélange et comprenant: une partie mélangeuse consistant en plusieurs rouleaux mélangeurs et un système d'entraînement et son moteur, toutes les parties à l'exception des rouleaux étant couvertes par un carter comportant: une entrée d'air entourant les arbres des rouleaux et une sortie d'air munie d'un moyen abaissant la pression à l'intérieur du carter.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Fa